    "pros": [
      "Designed for quick-lighting wood packs and pellets",
      "Removable ash pan and cover included, per listings",
      "25-inch size seats a family comfortably",
      "Stainless steel construction"
    ],
    "cons": [
      "Wood packs are an ongoing cost",
      "Mixed owner reports on build quality and assembly",
      "Heat and smoke performance less consistent with ordinary logs"
    ],
    "bottomLine": "If you want a fire with almost no effort and are happy buying pellets or wood packs, the TIKI 25-inch pit is the easiest to use."
